                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 620,
                  "content": "Token\n{category}.{role}.{state}\n예: color.probability.high.fill\n예: text.station.name\n\nCSS custom property\n--{category}-{role}-{state}\n예: --color-probability-high-fill\n예: --text-station-name-size\n\nComponent\nCategory / Component / Variant / State\n예: Forecast / StationRow / Expanded / Selected\n\n금지\n--roe-* 접두사, Rectangle 32, Group 8",
