                  "content": "route_card_selected\n  route_id, previous_route_id\nstation_row_toggled\n  route_id, station_id, expanded\nforecast_refresh_requested\n  route_id, trigger: manual | timer\nforecast_refresh_completed\n  latency_ms, source: network | cache\nerror_viewed\n  kind, request_id?, retry_after?\nerror_recovery_clicked\n  kind, action: back | retry\n\n금지: 좌석 수·정류장 확률을 사용자 식별자와 결합",
